  m_Text: "<color=#E09A3E>MODELOS 3D</color>\nDetetive (base \"Man in Suit\", CC0)
    \u2014 Quaternius\nHalloween Bits \u2014 Kay Lousberg\nRev\xF3lver \u2014 austincford\nElementary
    Dungeon Pack Lite \u2014 Gridness Studios\nEsqueleto \u2014 SazenGames\n\n<color=#E09A3E>FONTES</color>\nUnifrakturMaguntia
    \u2014 j. \"mach\" wust (SIL OFL)\nSpecial Elite \u2014 Astigmatic (Apache 2.0)\n\n<color=#E09A3E>M\xDASICA
    E SONS</color>\nTrilha original \u2014 Vinicius Vaes Massagli\nEfeitos sintetizados
    por c\xF3digo pela equipe"
